<title>USA: Great Falls HSD A, Mont. won by D.A. Davidson.</title>
<headline>Great Falls HSD A, Mont. won by D.A. Davidson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>D.A. Davidson said it won $5 million of Great Falls HSD A, Mont., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.75 percent.</p>
</text>
